Renderer::~Renderer(){try{idle();}catch(...){}if(constants&&mapped)constants->Unmap(0,nullptr);if(overlayBuffer&&overlayMapped)overlayBuffer->Unmap(0,nullptr);if(event)CloseHandle(event);}
std::vector<std::string> Renderer::validationErrors()const{std::vector<std::string> errors;ComPtr<ID3D12InfoQueue> info;if(SUCCEEDED(device.As(&info))){for(UINT64 i=0;i<info->GetNumStoredMessages();i++){SIZE_T size=0;info->GetMessage(i,nullptr,&size);std::vector<BYTE> bytes(size);auto*m=(D3D12_MESSAGE*)bytes.data();if(SUCCEEDED(info->GetMessage(i,m,&size))&&m->Severity<=D3D12_MESSAGE_SEVERITY_ERROR)errors.emplace_back(m->pDescription);}}return errors;}
